{
  "id": "minimax-h3-prism-dmad-pdmd-pack",
  "name": "Community — MiniMax H3 (PRISM DMAD PDMD)",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "OliviaRossi (merge of Singularity v2 and 10Eros Max); Zhengming Yu et al. (DMAD), Zimo Wang et al. and Iwannapose (PDMD)",
  "nsfw": false,
  "description": "Model format: w6a8 (6-bit weights, group size 32) with ConvRot. Steps: 8 by default.\n\nOliviaRossi's PRISM DMAD PDMD: her PRISM merge of Singularity v2 and 10Eros Max, with the DMAD and PDMD distillations built in. Text, image and reference to video from one 14.8 GB file, the author's smaller W6A8 version, with no LoRA to load and nothing to install. It downloads from Hugging Face, so no Civitai key is needed. Eight steps by default (euler, simple, shift 12/3, no CFG); the slider covers four to ten. Checked 2026-11-15 on a 12 GB RTX 4070 Ti beside the Hybrid DMAD PDMD pack on the same seeds, prompts and references: grittier skin and more texture, livelier faces and more motion, and it follows camera moves more closely. About 65 to 75 s per five-second shot at 480p in the app. In reference to video the person stays recognisable, but the face is held less closely than on the Hybrid DMAD PDMD pack. Works with the app's Faster Attention toggle.",
  "tags": [
    "8-Step",
    "I2V",
    "Local",
    "Merge",
    "MiniMax H3",
    "R2V",
    "T2V",
    "Video"
  ],
