      "previewImage": "previews/minimax-h3-prism-dmad-pdmd-t2v.jpg",
      "description": "Describe a scene and get video with synchronised audio. This is OliviaRossi's PRISM DMAD PDMD: her merge of Singularity v2 and 10Eros Max, with the DMAD and PDMD distillations built in. There is no LoRA to load and nothing extra to install.\n\nThe picture is textured and lively: grittier skin, bigger expressions and more motion than the Hybrid DMAD PDMD pack on the same prompts, and it follows a camera move such as a push-in or a dolly more closely.\n\nEight steps by default: about 65 s per five-second shot at 480p on a 12 GB card with Faster Attention on. The slider goes from four (about 40 s) to ten (about 75 s).\n\nA scripted line came out word for word at four, six, eight and ten steps.\n\nDownloads from Hugging Face, so no Civitai key is needed.\n\nModel format: w6a8 (6-bit weights, group size 32) with ConvRot.",
