          "sizeGB": 36,
          "notes": "ONE checkpoint serves all three presets (14.8 GB W6A8 g32 + ConvRot, from Hugging Face, no key; the author's int8 file is 18.9 GB and gave the same pictures in our bake, about 10% slower). Eight steps by default, euler/simple, sigma shift 12.0 video / 3.0 audio, no CFG. The author recommends the beta57 scheduler, which needs RES4LYF; ComfyUI's beta scheduler at alpha 0.5 / beta 0.7 gave near-identical pictures to simple in our bake, so the cards use simple. The distillation is baked in, so there is no Turbo LoRA. MEASURED 2026-11-15 (RTX 4070 Ti 12 GB, 864x480, 5 s, engine 0.45.0, faster attention on): through the app, 63-68 s per text-to-video shot at eight steps (two runs), 39 s at four, 51 s at six and 75 s at ten; 67-69 s per image-to-video shot and 68-75 s per reference shot at eight steps. Engine-direct over 36 clips: 62-73 s (W6A8) and 69-81 s (int8). Spectrum step-skipping is deliberately NOT enabled: it garbled a spoken line on other distilled H3 checkpoints."
