      "description": "Make video with synchronised audio from up to nine reference pictures on OliviaRossi's PRISM DMAD PDMD, a merge of Singularity v2 and 10Eros Max with the distillation built in.\n\nPeople: a solo and a two-person set stayed recognisable over three seeds, with the right hair, skin and clothes. The face is held less closely than on the Hybrid DMAD PDMD pack, and expressions run bigger than in the reference photo.\n\nPlaces: a wide picture of an empty place worked on four of four shots, boats, lighthouse and cottages included. A close-up of an object in its setting (a telescope on a balcony) brought only the object, never the balcony, on three of three seeds. Give it the whole place.\n\nAbout 70 to 75 s per five-second shot at 480p on a 12 GB card with Faster Attention on, at eight steps.\n\nDownloads from Hugging Face, so no Civitai key is needed.\n\nModel format: w6a8 (6-bit weights, group size 32) with ConvRot.",
